[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5930213251","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123907#issuecomment-5930213251","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123907","id":5930213251,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYXffgw","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T11:16:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T11:16:55Z","body":"Thank you for adding this! I made a test project which adds a few rectangles and a circular polygon, and it's already working as expected. The clickable regions are highlighted in red:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a82ca52-d99e-43b1-9fa4-38105829207f\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5930213251/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5974197299","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123907#issuecomment-5974197299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123907","id":5974197299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZBcEMw","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-03T22:34:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T22:34:31Z","body":"I did some testing on weston and sway. Took a second to figure out how to pass the right data, but it seems to work.\r\n\r\nI was aware of this approach and, while it works, it's somewhat worrying as it's basically a hack. I still feel that there should be either a poly input region protocol addition, a rect-based passthrough API here, or some other thing. Notably enough this is not buffer-accurate as it works at logical scales, so people should not expect pixel accuracy in scaled setups even like this.\r\n\r\nI did _not_ do a sweep test on all compositors. Worringly enough, for some reason, my laptop made (somewhat consistently) a weird whining noise on sway when the passthrough was set.\r\n\r\nI am slightly worried that some implementations won't like this but I guess that _technically_ they should all, in one way or another, eat the message spam up. Worst case, we can reduce the message count somehow if the need arises. I don't think I'm up rn for finding/proposing a better alternative either upstream nor downstream so this is the best we'll get.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5974197299/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6177017429","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123907#issuecomment-6177017429","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123907","id":6177017429,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcC3OVQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-14T19:52:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T19:52:16Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6177017429/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]